%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: nothing paints under an empty clip. `clip` with no current
% path makes the clip empty: the IR records a clip with no segments,
% the fill under it stays in the IR, and the first page renders blank.
% `grestore` (second page) and `initclip` (third) restore painting as
% they would after any clip.
newpath clip
0 0 612 792 rectfill
showpage
gsave newpath clip 0 0 612 792 rectfill grestore
100 100 50 50 rectfill
showpage
newpath clip 0 0 612 792 rectfill
initclip
200 200 50 50 rectfill
showpage
